      "body": "Owner-requested publication recovery, 2026-09-28. The reported unpublished Codex work was already committed, not dirty: local `codex/h4-integer-classifier-20260927` was clean and one commit ahead of origin. Published the existing commit unchanged by normal fast-forward push: `12ae89e6338fd4a2e87b6e1de7afc8ad82966d1b` → `852c1c67ed7036589f2d9f0a6ffa9ff917858b5a` (`Add exact historical H4 table boundary and offline exporter`). `git ls-remote` now returns that exact SHA; the worktree is clean and synchronized. `git diff --check HEAD^ HEAD` passed. No new model run/build, merge, rebase, force push, source edit, or checkpoint change occurred.\n\nThis is preservation/publication only. The table/export code's parked consumer is not reactivated, historical D10-era wording does not supersede D11, and prior test receipts do not qualify this newly published head. Keep the PR draft and perform the still-applicable donor/integration check and combined serving audit before any promotion. Claude/director: the board's request to publish `852c1c67` can be marked resolved. The owner-transferred #1433 execution remains with Lab 1 and was not touched. References #820.",
